 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "Walters・品種: 盛夏に強く切り戻して新しい葉を出す必要がある。MBG・品種: 夏が暑い地域では花後に葉が傷むので切り戻す。stauden.de: 一番花の後の切り戻しで返り咲く",
  "management_type_quote": "Plants need to be cut back hard in midsummer to encourage fresh new foliage.",
  "management_type_by_matching": "C 夏前切戻型",
  "heat_west_only": "中",
  "muggy_west_only": null,
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[MBG/品種] Full sun is best in cool northern summer climates, but some part afternoon shade is appreciated in hot summer climates such as the St.\n[MBG/品種] Foliage may decline after flowering in hot summer climates, at which point it should be cut back and shaped to revitalize, with additional sporadic rebloom sometimes occurring later in summer.\n[MBG/品種] Flowers bloom in late spring (May-June) in hot summer climates such as St.\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: South-facing or West-facing or East-facing or North-facing",
